  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanda EAQIP - Clean Cooking in Schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to Rwanda&#x2019;s efforts to achieve the goals set out in its NDC, which includes promoting the use of efficient cook stoves as a mitigation measure, and the targets in the National Strategy for Transformation 2017-2024 to reduce the number of households depending on firewood for cooking purposes from 79.9% (2016/17) to 42% by 2024, and the Energy Sector Strategic Plan to  halve the number of households using traditional cooking technologies.  Danish support will be a key deliverable for the Danish government&#x2019;s ambition to support access to clean and renewable energy for more people in Africa in line with Denmark&#x2019;s new Strategy for Development Cooperation and the long-term Global Climate Action Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
